  "text": "### Level 3: Department Head Resolution  \n**Authority:** Department Head (e.g., Head of Retail Banking, Head of Compliance)\n**Approval Limit:** £5,000–£50,000\n**Examples:**\n- Significant complaint resolution (substantial refund)\n- Regulatory exception requests\n- High-value fraud investigation\n- Product exception request\n- Vendor/partnership dispute\n- AML/KYC escalation (high-risk customer decision)  \n**Response Time:** 3–5 business days  \n**Escalation Condition:** If unresolved or >£50k impact → Escalate to Level 4  \n---",
